                <h4>Our Mission</h4>
                <p>To empower businesses worldwide with cutting-edge software engineering, seamless user experiences, and scalable cloud architectures that accelerate growth.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i></div>
